+WHAT IT PROVES (★ = the four properties the task names; every group carries a control that must go RED)
+  [B] BASELINE GREEN FIRST: the harness itself reproduces the adapter's arithmetic on a fixture (the stripped executor's
+      target == w/gross_in x NAV x gross_mult after the reshape it performs), before any M3 claim is judged.
+  [C] config: absent / off / shadow / on; a typo or a non-object is OFF + an error (never an accidental ON).
